Package: xmlvet
Type: Package
Title: Check, Canonicalize and Query XML Files
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A command-line tool that checks XML files for well-formedness,
    writes their canonical form, lists their element paths, selects values with
    a small path language and compares two documents.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
